				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Gears</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>172464</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I wrote this a while ago, and let it sit. Finally, I decided to just post the dang thing, with a couple disclaimers.</p> <ol> <li>Not saying this is canon. At all.</li> <li>Still not saying this is canon.</li> <li>I view this as a alternate time line/far future scenario, at best, and silly fan fiction at worst.</li> <li>No, you probably shouldn't make a story like this. You are you, I am Gears, and for some reason people take experimental and otherwise offensive stuff from me better then you.</li> <li>Kondraki: Please don't shoot me anyplace vital.</li> </ol> <p>With that said, hope you enjoy.</p> 
				 	]]>
